      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If someone is to loud / to quiet they should just adjust them self instead of needing everyone else to adjust. \n5% Volume is basically muting someone, so just do that instead? \nAnd if the environment you are in is to loud, just change either the world volume or the voices volume.",
