  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-12-22T22:23:44.418Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I feel as the max Possible Volume You can put a user should be 200% and the Minimum should be 1%\nSometimes People Aren't Loud Enough On 150% Due To Mic Quality or Even Just In General In Loud Enviroments and Sometimes 5% isn't Low enough without Feeling The Need To Mute Someone",
